Dear Ruben,

On behalf of Harbor Line Elevator Co., I am pleased to offer you the position of Elevator Mechanic Helper (Requisition R-2026-01844) in our Long Beach branch, reporting to Field Supervisor Andre Kimball.

Summary of the offer:
- Position: Elevator Mechanic Helper (non-exempt, full-time)
- Pay rate: $28.50 per hour, paid bi-weekly
- Anticipated start date: Monday, June 1, 2026
- Schedule: Monday-Friday, 6:30 AM - 3:00 PM, with occasional overtime
- Benefits: medical, dental and vision eligibility on the first of the month following 60 days; 401(k) with company match after 6 months; 10 paid holidays
- Tool allowance: $400 annually

Your formal offer letter is ready for electronic signature:
https://sign.harborlineelevator.example/offer/HL-2026-0582

Please review and sign by Friday, May 15, 2026. As discussed, employment is subject to our standard pre-employment screening and verification of your eligibility to work in the United States.

Once you accept, our onboarding team will send instructions for your pre-start paperwork in Workday. If you have any questions about the offer, please contact me directly.

We're excited to have you join the team.

Sincerely,

Tom Agbaje
Recruiter | Harbor Line Elevator Co.
